# ~/.config/audio-input-priority/devices
# One CoreAudio input device name per line, best first. Globs * and ? allowed (case-insensitive).
# Get exact names with: audio-input-priority --list
# Built-in mic is skipped automatically while the lid is closed.
# A manual pick of any listed device is kept until a device is plugged/unplugged or the lid changes.
fifine Microphone
MX Brio
*Pods*
MacBook Pro Microphone
